<title>USA: TENNIS-ATP CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ATP CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MASON, Ohio 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $2.3</p>
<p>million ATP Championships on Monday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>9-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>12-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat Cedric Pioline (France) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>13-Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) 7-6 (7-4) 6-1</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) beat 15-Tim Henman (Britain) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>16-Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat Magnus Larsson (Sweden) 5-7 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) 3-6 7-6 (7-3) 6-3</p>
<p>Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat Olivier Delaitre (France) 6-2 3-6 6-0</p>
<p>Jonathan Stark (U.S.) beat Greg Rusedski (Britain) 6-1 3-6 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Martin Damm (Czech Republic) beat Guillaume Raoux (France) 6-3 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>Tommy Haas (Germany) beat Grant Stafford (South Africa) 6-4 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) beat Brett Steven (New Zealand) 7-6 (7-5) 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>Jiri Novak (Czech Republic) beat Marc Kevin Goellner (Germany) 7-5 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Vince Spadea (U.S.) beat Jerome Golmard (France) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>David Wheaton (U.S.) beat Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) 7-6 (7-5) 6-2</p>
</text>
